@startuml diagrama_de_pacotes
' =====================================================================
' Sistema de Aluguel de Automoveis
' Diagrama de Pacotes (Visao Logica) - Lab02S01
' Fonte versionada em docs/diagramas/diagrama-de-pacotes.puml
' Dois subsistemas (conforme enunciado): backend Spring (gestao de
' pedidos e contratos, expondo API REST) e frontend Vue.js (construcao
' dinamica das paginas web), que consome essa API via HTTP/JSON.
' =====================================================================

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "frontend (Vue.js)" as frontend <<subsistema: construcao dinamica das paginas web>> {
  package "views" as feViews
  package "components" as feComponents
  package "router" as feRouter
  package "store" as feStore
  package "services" as feServices
}

package "backend (Spring Boot)" as backend <<subsistema: gestao de pedidos e contratos>> {
  package "com.xulambs_aluguel.xulu" {
    package "controller" as controller
    package "dto" as dto
    package "model" as model
    package "service" as service
    package "repository" as repository
  }
}

' ============================ DEPENDENCIAS =============================

feRouter ..> feViews      : navega para
feViews ..> feComponents  : usa
feViews ..> feStore       : le / atualiza
feStore ..> feServices    : usa

controller ..> service   : usa
controller ..> dto       : recebe / devolve

dto ..> model            : mapeia

service ..> model        : opera sobre
service ..> repository   : usa

repository ..> model     : persiste

feServices ..> controller : <<HTTP / JSON>>\nconsome API REST

note bottom of frontend
  SPA em Vue.js. "views" = paginas roteadas,
  "components" = elementos reutilizaveis,
  "store" = estado da aplicacao (Pinia/Vuex),
  "services" = chamadas HTTP a API REST do
  backend (HU21/RF25).
end note

note bottom of backend
  Expoe API REST (controller/dto) e concentra
  as regras de negocio de pedidos, avaliacao,
  contratos e automoveis (RF01-RF24). Nao possui
  camada de View em Java - a renderizacao das
  paginas e responsabilidade do frontend.
end note

@enduml
